**Playbooks:** guides for approaching sales in a specific country or market. Each playbook may contain:
- Target industries
- Prospecting strategies
- Calling scripts
- Email templates
- Common objections
- Local compliance guidance

**Rule:** Only use approved materials. Do not modify scripts to make claims that have not been approved.`
